      "content": "you talk about seeking help and talking to people, but that just feels like more noise. more anchors trying to pull me back into a world i don't even fit in. if the whole point of me being here is just to keep struggling and feeling this weight, then maybe the drift is actually the answer. isn't there a kind of beauty in just... finally being silent? in just letting the nothingness take over?",
